# #5833. The switch's close records a head one below the allocator head, so the last
# record allocated before it lies at the head, not below it.
MODULE: SwitchCloseCoversPriorAllocationsCloseHeadBelowAllocator
TARGET: SwitchCloseCoversPriorAllocations
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the switch's close records a head below the allocator head
PERTURBS: Close

--- FIND
    /\ closeHead' = IF tokOpen /\ ~Pending THEN next ELSE closeHead
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: one below the allocator head.
    /\ closeHead' = IF tokOpen /\ ~Pending THEN next - 1 ELSE closeHead
--- END
